Fixed the Node 26 install failure by bumping `better-sqlite3` to v13, which ships prebuilt binaries for Node 26. The full quality bar passes and the change is pushed to PR #6.

**Changes:**
- `better-sqlite3`: `^11.8.1` → `^13.0.0` (resolves to 13.0.3)
- `@types/better-sqlite3`: `^7.6.12` → `^9.6.0`
- README: tested Node range documented as 20–26
- `engines.node`: `>=20` (unchanged)

